# Never ship local env files to the Vercel build.
# Production env vars come from the Vercel dashboard. Shipping .env caused
# NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000 to leak into prod, which made the auth
# handler set a NON-secure session cookie while the HTTPS edge middleware
# expected the __Secure- cookie — breaking every logged-in session.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
